# 重构任务：废弃 IUIService，统一到 IMetadataService

## 背景

`IUIService` 是 `IMetadataService` 的一个冗余子集。`IMetadataService` 已经是泛型的 `(type, name)` 接口，view/dashboard 只是 `type` 参数的不同值。同时 `IMetadataService` 已有完整的三层 Overlay 系统（system → platform → user）和 `getEffective()` 方法，完全覆盖了 UI 自定义和权限分层的需求。

当前 `IUIService` 的所有方法都可以用 `IMetadataService` 一对一替代：
- `getView(name)` → `metadata.get('view', name)`
- `listViews(object?)` → `metadata.list('view')` + filter
- `registerView(name, def)` → `metadata.register('view', name, def)`
- `getDashboard(name)` → `metadata.get('dashboard', name)`
- `listDashboards()` → `metadata.list('dashboard')`
- `registerDashboard(name, def)` → `metadata.register('dashboard', name, def)`

## 宪法约束

所有修改必须遵循 `@objectstack/spec` 中定义的协议（Zod schemas、contracts、kernel 类型），不得破坏现有 schema 兼容性。

## 需要修改的文件和具体操作

### Phase 1：增强 IMetadataService，补齐 UI 场景缺失的能力

#### 1.1 增强 `getEffective` 签名，支持 auth context

**文件：** `packages/spec/src/contracts/metadata-service.ts`

在 `getEffective` 方法签名中增加可选的 context 参数：

```typescript
getEffective?(type: string, name: string, context?: {
  userId?: string;
  tenantId?: string;
  roles?: string[];
  permissions?: string[];
}): Promise<unknown | undefined>;
```

这样调用方可以传入当前用户信息，`getEffective` 能自动定位正确的 user overlay。

#### 1.2 在 IMetadataService 中添加 UI convenience methods

**文件：** `packages/spec/src/contracts/metadata-service.ts`

在 IMetadataService 接口末尾添加（与已有的 `getObject` / `listObjects` 对称）：

```typescript
// ==========================================
// Convenience: UI Metadata
// ==========================================

/**
 * Convenience: get a view definition by name
 * Equivalent to get('view', name)
 */
getView?(name: string): Promise<unknown | undefined>;

/**
 * Convenience: list view definitions, optionally filtered by object
 */
listViews?(object?: string): Promise<unknown[]>;

/**
 * Convenience: get a dashboard definition by name
 * Equivalent to get('dashboard', name)
 */
getDashboard?(name: string): Promise<unknown | undefined>;

/**
 * Convenience: list all dashboard definitions
 */
listDashboards?(): Promise<unknown[]>;
```

#### 1.3 在 MetadataManager 中实现这些 convenience methods

**文件：** `packages/metadata/src/metadata-manager.ts`

添加实现（参考已有的 `getObject` / `listObjects` 模式）：

```typescript
async getView(name: string): Promise<unknown | undefined> {
  return this.get('view', name);
}

async listViews(object?: string): Promise<unknown[]> {
  const views = await this.list('view');
  if (object) {
    return views.filter((v: any) => v?.object === object);
  }
  return views;
}

async getDashboard(name: string): Promise<unknown | undefined> {
  return this.get('dashboard', name);
}

async listDashboards(): Promise<unknown[]> {
  return this.list('dashboard');
}
```

#### 1.4 增强 `getEffective` 实现，支持 userId 级别的 overlay 查找

**文件：** `packages/metadata/src/metadata-manager.ts`

修改现有 `getEffective` 方法：

```typescript
async getEffective(type: string, name: string, context?: {
  userId?: string;
  tenantId?: string;
  roles?: string[];
  permissions?: string[];
}): Promise<unknown | undefined> {
  const base = await this.get(type, name);
  if (!base) return undefined;

  let effective = { ...(base as Record<string, unknown>) };

  // Apply platform overlay
  const platformOverlay = await this.getOverlay(type, name, 'platform');
  if (platformOverlay?.active && platformOverlay.patch) {
    effective = { ...effective, ...platformOverlay.patch };
  }

  // Apply user overlay (scoped to specific user if context provided)
  if (context?.userId) {
    // Look up user-specific overlay by owner
    const userOverlayKey = this.overlayKey(type, name, 'user') + `:${context.userId}`;
    const userOverlay = this.overlays.get(userOverlayKey) 
      ?? await this.getOverlay(type, name, 'user');
    if (userOverlay?.active && userOverlay.patch) {
      // Only apply if owner matches (or no owner restriction)
      if (!userOverlay.owner || userOverlay.owner === context.userId) {
        effective = { ...effective, ...userOverlay.patch };
      }
    }
  } else {
    const userOverlay = await this.getOverlay(type, name, 'user');
    if (userOverlay?.active && userOverlay.patch) {
      effective = { ...effective, ...userOverlay.patch };
    }
  }

  return effective;
}
```

### Phase 2：标记 IUIService 为 deprecated

#### 2.1 标记接口 deprecated

**文件：** `packages/spec/src/contracts/ui-service.ts`

在 `IUIService` 接口上方添加 `@deprecated` JSDoc：

```typescript
